context:
DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/images/v1/{image_id}
Delete an image on Cloudflare Images. On success, all copies of the image are deleted and purged from cache.
Required: image_id (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/images/v1/{image_id}
Fetch details for a CF Images image.
Required: image_id (path); account_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/images/v1/keys/{signing_key_name}
Create a new CF Images signing key with specified name. Returns all keys available.
Required: signing_key_name (path); account_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/images/v1/keys/{signing_key_name}
Delete a CF Images signing key with specified name. Returns all keys available. When the last key is removed, a new default signing key will be generated.
Required: signing_key_name (path); account_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/images/v2/sourcingkit/migrations/{migration_id}
Delete an existing migration. Only completed, errored, or aborted migrations can be deleted.
Required: account_id (path); migration_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/images/v2/sourcingkit/sources/{source_id}
Delete an existing migration source. Sources with active migrations cannot be deleted.
Required: account_id (path); source_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/images/v2/sourcingkit/migrations/{migration_id}
Fetch details for a single migration.
Required: account_id (path); migration_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/images/v2/sourcingkit/sources/{source_id}
Fetch details for a single migration source.
Required: account_id (path); source_id (path)

PATCH /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/images/v2/sourcingkit/sources/{source_id}
Update the name of an existing migration source.
Required: account_id (path); source_id (path); body (body)

PATCH /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/images/v1/{image_id}
Update a CF Images image's metadata, creator, or access control. On access control change, all copies of the image are purged from cache.
Required: image_id (path); account_id (path); body (body)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/images/v1/variants/{variant_id}
Delete a CF Images variant. This will purge the cache for all images associated with the variant.
Required: variant_id (path); account_id (path)

PATCH /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/images/v1/variants/{variant_id}
Update a CF Images variant. This will purge the cache for all images associated with the variant.
Required: variant_id (path); account_id (path); body (body)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/images/v1/variants/{variant_id}
Fetch details for a CF Images variant.
Required: variant_id (path); account_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{accountId}/v1/images/{imageId}
Delete an image.
Required: accountId (path) — Account identifier.; imageId (path) — Image identifier.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{accountId}/v1/images/{imageId}
Get image metadata.
Required: accountId (path) — Account identifier.; imageId (path) — Image identifier.
